The scene layer in this package was merged from two projects by the same author, and parts of it are copied from them:

- Osprey (https://github.com/grayslawson/osprey, MIT): the provider cooldown, task config, label criteria, the rules floor,
  the tile question and its validation, the interest score, and the shape of the map store (osprey/assist/providers.py,
  decide.py, survey_understand.py, survey_map.py, survey_store.py).
- Kestrel (private, same author): the provider config keys private and extra_body, the whole-picture chat labeller, the tile
  merge, polygon geometry, segmentation and refinement (kestrel/scene/*).

No pictures or model weights from either project are included. Segmentation models are not bundled; their licences are the
user's to accept.
